# Timestamped result files are run-local measurements, not part of the tool.
# Keep the directory (see results/.gitkeep) but don't track individual runs
# by default. Commit specific result files yourself if you want to keep a
# historical record in version control.
results/*.md
results/*.csv
!results/.gitkeep
!results/CI-RESULTS.md
!results/WSL-BENCH-RESULTS.md
!results/wsl-runs/
!results/wsl-runs/**

full-mode-test.log
